<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀάατος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀάω</span>) in <i><span class="en">
			Il.
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">¯̆</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be injured, inviolable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῦν μοι ὄμθσσον ἀ. Στυγὸς ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.271
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">¯̆</span>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄεθλος ἀ. ἐκτετέλεσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.9
			</span></i>, prob. <i>unimpeachable,</i> i.e. <i>decisive.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> later, <i>invincible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτος ἀάᾰτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.77
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀάϝατος,</span> cf. sq., <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
